     8	
     9	Project skill for every agent writing or reviewing a Claude Code hook in the gobbi codebase. Loaded at Study phase when a task touches `.claude/hooks/` or asks for guidance on hook design.
    10	
    11	Two in-tree witnesses ground every rule below. Read them fully before any hook work:
    12	
