    17	
    18	## When to load
    19	
    20	- When editing any file under `.claude/hooks/`
    21	- When constructing a delegation prompt for an executor whose task creates or modifies a hook
    22	- When evaluating a hook-authoring artifact
    23	- When the task description references hook registration, stdin JSON payload, or `session.json` upsert patterns
